THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This repository CONSUMES, but does not incorporate, the AGPL-3.0 licensed
`jyotish-engine` package. That package executes exclusively in client-side contexts
(mobile applications on end-user devices, and WebAssembly in end-user browsers).

No server-side component in this repository links to, bundles, embeds, or invokes
AGPL-licensed code. This separation is what permits this repository to remain
proprietary. It is documented in docs/AGPL-BOUNDARY.md and enforced by
scripts/check_agpl_boundary.sh in CI.

Do not remove that check.
